      "order": 0,
      "required": 0,
      "default": "<p class=\"tfd-intro-text\">This application allows approved customers to pay after their event, within 30 days of the invoice date, instead of paying in full before the event. Please complete every section, sign where indicated, and return by email to bookings@thefundepot.com.au. Incomplete applications cannot be processed.</p>",
