      "default": "<p class=\"tfd-section-note\">I/We hereby authorise The Fun Depot (KGO Enterprises Pty Ltd) to make oral or written inquiries with the bank or financial institution named above to obtain information in support of this application. Information will be handled in accordance with the Privacy Act 1988 (Cth).</p>",
